# Per-package LICENSE copies are a prepack build artifact — npm only packs a
# LICENSE that lives inside the package dir, so apps/mcp and apps/cli copy the
# root LICENSE in at prepack time. The single source of truth is the root LICENSE.
/apps/*/LICENSE
